Fonts
  - Noto Sans, Noto Serif, Noto Sans Mono, and script-specific Noto faces in
    packages/engine/public/fonts/, including their shaping-only derivatives,
    except for Noto Color Emoji and Noto Sans SC below. The OpenType name
    records identify The Noto Project Authors: 2022 for most faces, 2024 for
    Hebrew, and 2025 for Bengali. The family repositories recorded in those
    name tables are:
    https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic,
    https://github.com/notofonts/arabic, https://github.com/notofonts/armenian,
    https://github.com/notofonts/bengali, https://github.com/notofonts/devanagari,
    https://github.com/notofonts/ethiopic, https://github.com/notofonts/georgian,
    https://github.com/notofonts/gujarati, https://github.com/notofonts/gurmukhi,
    https://github.com/notofonts/hebrew, https://github.com/notofonts/kannada,
    https://github.com/notofonts/khmer, https://github.com/notofonts/lao,
    https://github.com/notofonts/malayalam, https://github.com/notofonts/myanmar,
    https://github.com/notofonts/sinhala, https://github.com/notofonts/symbols,
    https://github.com/notofonts/tamil, https://github.com/notofonts/telugu,
    and https://github.com/notofonts/thai.
    Seventeen script faces are byte-identical to the hinted TTFs in
    https://github.com/notofonts/notofonts.github.io at commit
    5c3913063bb189df4edc94b766584dfb4c04a187 (fonts/NotoSans<Script>/hinted/ttf/).
    Noto Sans, Noto Sans Italic, Noto Serif, and Noto Sans Mono are the
    google/fonts ofl/ variable fonts with the wdth axis pinned to 100 and glyph
    names removed. Noto Sans Devanagari and Noto Sans Symbols2 match upstream
    by version only; their exact source build is not recorded.
    SIL Open Font License 1.1, see packages/engine/public/fonts/OFL.txt
  - Noto Color Emoji
    (packages/engine/public/fonts/noto-color-emoji.woff2 and
    packages/engine/public/fonts/noto-color-emoji.shaping.otf)
    Source: https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji
    Upstream OFL text: https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji/blob/main/LICENSE
    Copyright 2013 Google LLC in the upstream OFL text. The stored font's
    OpenType name record says Copyright 2022 Google Inc. The WOFF2 has its
    SVG table removed by scripts/strip-emoji-svg.py; the shaping OTF is a
    derived asset. SIL Open Font License 1.1, see
    licenses/OFL-1.1-Noto-Color-Emoji.txt
  - Noto Sans SC CJK
    (packages/engine/public/fonts/NotoSansCJKsc-Regular.woff2 and
    packages/engine/public/fonts/NotoSansCJKsc-Regular.shaping.otf)
    The shaping OTF's OpenType name record identifies Noto Sans SC
    version 2.004;GOOG;NotoSansSC-Regular;ADOBE, copyright metadata
    © 2014-2021 Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), and OFL 1.1. The WOFF2 is a
    lossless conversion of Sans/SubsetOTF/SC/NotoSansSC-Regular.otf from
    https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk tag Sans2.004 (commit
    523d033d6cb47f4a80c58a35753646f5c3608a78). The full OFL text,
    including Adobe's Reserved Font Name notice, is in
    licenses/OFL-1.1-Noto-SC.txt; upstream license source:
    https://github.com/google/fonts/blob/main/ofl/notosanssc/OFL.txt
  - Noto Sans KR (packages/engine/public/fonts/NotoSansKR.ttf and
    NotoSansKR.shaping.otf)
    Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), with Reserved Font Name
